    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0f462161b952e456",
      "translationZh": "onPanda 专为极客、高级用户、充满好奇心的人和工程师设计。其用户界面旨在支持深入探索和高效的数据标注。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3c970a05c9ca491e",
      "translationZh": "核心操作循环很简单：将鼠标悬停在一个词元上 → 点击一个替代项或自由编辑 → 继续生成。你可以编辑 onPanda 展示的模型输出的每一部分，包括推理和工具调用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "dc8223d93ceeca8b",
      "translationZh": "直接编辑提示词，为工具调用创建分支，并使用树状结构记录分支历史。这使 onPanda 适用于模型检查和提示词工程。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bb23cb8dbc30ac2d",
      "translationZh": "支持多种模态，包括图像、视频和音频；使用工具调用并连接 MCP 服务器，在真实环境中执行任务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e48354fd6ae47152",
      "translationZh": "连接 Claude Code、Codex 和 OpenCode 等流行的智能体运行框架来执行任务。探索并比较它们的工具集、系统提示词、技能和记忆机制。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d27167ced9d143dc",
      "translationZh": "onPanda 包含 browser-agent，这是一个无需安装即可在用户浏览器中运行的智能体。它使用浏览器作为运行框架，并提供 JavaScript 执行、信息检索、界面交互、多媒体输入/输出、本地文件访问和持久记忆功能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3ca2d5cc2c9c7591",
      "translationZh": "onPanda 是 on-Policy Alignment Data Annotator（同策略对齐数据标注器）的缩写。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aa0e2c7f17b50792",
      "translationZh": "我从 2024.09 开始开发 onPanda，花了两年时间才逐步完善它的功能和易用性。在我看来，onPanda 非常适合 r/LocalLLaMA 社区。欢迎任何反馈和评价。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6e5a5ea05688ab6b",
      "translationZh": "在线试用（支持移动设备）：https://onpanda.diyer22.com/",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0fa46c7dfa1c9914",
      "translationZh": "用于自行托管的 GitHub 仓库：https://github.com/on-panda/on-panda",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
